lyc = "[00:00.00]Hero - Mili (ミリー)
[00:02.06]Lyrics by：Cassie Wei
[00:03.43]Composed by：Cassie Wei/Yamato Kasai
[00:05.49][color=yellow]We're swaying on horseback
[00:08.22][color=yellow]The hills are green
[00:09.97][color=yellow]And the birdies sing
[00:12.23][color=yellow]And roses are pink
[00:14.83][color=yellow]Experience I never had
[00:17.42][color=yellow]I'm so happy
[00:19.11][color=yellow]Happy to just be part of your story
[00:24.67][color=yellow]After you I follow
[00:26.98][color=yellow]After you I follow
[00:29.27][color=yellow]The world you show me broaden my horizon
[00:33.80][color=yellow]Forever my hero
[00:36.16][color=yellow]Forever my hero
[00:38.57][color=yellow]I am your biggest fan
[00:40.85][color=yellow]I am your biggest fan
[00:47.04][color=yellow]Merry-go-round
[00:48.52][color=yellow]In a circle I run
[00:51.28][color=yellow]It's so much fun leaving reality behind
[01:00.80][color=red]I fall down the horseback
[01:03.58][color=red]With my crippled legs
[01:05.35][color=red]And then it starts to rain
[01:07.74][color=red]Showing me it's all fake
[01:10.17][color=red]Raindrops wash down the facade
[01:12.84][color=red]Hills are painted
[01:14.52][color=red]Birdies are robotic
[01:16.84][color=red]Roses are made of clay
[01:20.03][color=red]Excitement that I feel
[01:22.53][color=red]Excitement that I feel
[01:24.72][color=red]Return them to the shelf
[01:26.34][color=red]Cause now I understand
[01:29.24][color=red]Heroes cannot be real
[01:31.56][color=red]Heroes cannot be real
[01:33.83][color=red]I wasn't who I am
[01:36.35][color=red]I don't know who I am
[01:39.29][color=red]¿Who am I?
[01:41.59][color=red]¿Who am I?
[01:43.87][color=red]¿Who am I?
[01:46.95][color=yellow]Here we go another lap
[01:48.81][color=yellow]Prizes to claim
[01:50.03][color=yellow]Here's a dream for you
[01:51.55][color=yellow]Here's a dream for me
[01:53.11][color=yellow]Golden tickets in my bag stay unexchanged
[01:56.10][color=yellow]Don't you love the thrill of the chase?
[01:59.70][color=yellow]Just let me be your fan
[02:01.30][color=yellow]I wanna be your fan
[02:02.83][color=yellow]I'm still your biggest fan
[02:08.09][color=red]Why is it that some were given the role of villian
[02:15.90][color=red]The moment they were released into this system?
[02:25.31][color=yellow]Stand up
[02:26.34][color=yellow]Gallop on
[02:27.48][color=yellow]Nothing can be done by feeling so sorry for myself
[02:33.93][color=yellow]Hero
[02:35.53][color=yellow]On a plastic horse
[02:37.36][color=yellow]Fighting like it's real
[02:39.23][color=yellow]With a cardboard sword
[02:43.22][color=yellow]I know
[02:44.54][color=yellow]Successful or not I am who I am
[02:49.02][color=yellow]I am my biggest fan
[02:51.39][color=yellow]I am my biggest fan
[02:53.70][color=yellow]I am my enemy and my friend
